<helpdocument version="1.0">
<meta>
<topic id="textscalc01func_ifnaxml" indexer="include" status="PUBLISH">
<title id="tit" xml-lang="en-US">IFNA</title>
<filename>/text/scalc/01/func_ifna.xhp</filename>
</topic>
</meta>
<body>
<bookmark xml-lang="en-US" branch="index" id="bm_id3160001">
<bookmark_value>IFNA function</bookmark_value>
<bookmark_value>error handling;IFNA</bookmark_value>
<bookmark_value>#N/A;IFNA</bookmark_value>
</bookmark>
<bookmark xml-lang="en-US" branch="hid/SC_HID_FUNC_IFNA" id="bm_id3160002" localize="false"/>
<paragraph role="heading" id="hd_id3160001" xml-lang="en-US" level="2" l10n="U"><variable id="ifna"><link href="text/scalc/01/func_ifna.xhp">IFNA</link>
</variable></paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160003" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U"><ahelp hid="HID_FUNC_IFNA">Returns the value if the cell does not contain an #N/A error value, otherwise it returns the alternative value.</ahelp> Only the #N/A error is substituted; all other error values and ordinary values pass through unchanged.</paragraph>
<paragraph role="heading" id="hd_id3160004" xml-lang="en-US" level="3" l10n="U">Syntax</paragraph>
<paragraph role="code" id="par_id3160005" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U">IFNA(Value; Alternative)</paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160006" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U"><emph>Value</emph> is the value or reference to be checked for an #N/A error.</paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160007" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U"><emph>Alternative</emph> is the value returned when <emph>Value</emph> produces an #N/A error. It is evaluated only when <emph>Value</emph> is #N/A.</paragraph>
<paragraph role="heading" id="hd_id3160008" xml-lang="en-US" level="3" l10n="U">Remarks</paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160009" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U">IFNA distinguishes #N/A from other error values. Other errors (for example Err:502, Err:508, or DIV/0!) are not caught and are returned as-is.</paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160010" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U">When <emph>Value</emph> is a matrix, only matrix elements containing #N/A are replaced by <emph>Alternative</emph>; all other elements pass through unchanged.</paragraph>
<paragraph role="heading" id="hd_id3160011" xml-lang="en-US" level="3" l10n="U">Example</paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160012" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U"><item type="input">=IFNA(VLOOKUP("zzz";A1:B10;2;0); "Not found")</item> returns <quote>Not found</quote> when the lookup value is not present and produces #N/A.</paragraph>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160013" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U"><item type="input">=IFNA(1/0; 0)</item> returns Err:502 (division by zero) because IFNA does not catch errors other than #N/A.</paragraph>
<embed href="text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#siehe"/>
<paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3160014" xml-lang="en-US" l10n="U"><link href="text/scalc/01/04060104.xhp#isna" name="ISNA">ISNA</link>.</paragraph>
</body>
